<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY 27/28.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY 27/28.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May 27/28. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	   May 27-28	 May 26/27</p>
<p> CZK	0.41205	 0.44211</p>
<p> DKK	2.10083	 2.10043</p>
<p> FIM	2.65453	 2.65118</p>
<p> HUF	0.07467	 0.07457</p>
<p> JPY	0.11679	 0.0081</p>
<p> LTL	3.39079	 3.37182</p>
<p> LVL     23.86768	23.77155</p>
<p> RUR	0.00236	 0.00234</p>
<p> SEK	1.77964	 1.77626</p>
<p> UAH	7.30819	 7.26987</p>
<p> USD     13.564	  13.4856</p>
<p> XEU     15.59114	15.5725</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
